    "aieachrules": {
      "x": 3840,
      "y": 8620,
      "w": 400,
      "text": "Rules for the AI actions:\n\n1. A sparkle icon in the accent colour marks each AI action.\n2. An answer goes to the assistant panel, as a step of the current session. Exception: the commit message goes into the message field, and a change of the selection shows as a diff in the editor.\n3. The application never runs SQL and never runs a Git command from an answer. You accept each change.\n4. A request sends no rows. Only 'Ask about these rows' sends rows, after a confirmation.\n5. The Git console accepts git commands only. It runs no shell.",
      "color": "orange"
    },
